  "description": "Lee Ye-Won, a dog beastkin, is suddenly kicked out of his college dorm and has nowhere to go despite his approaching rut cycle. That’s when cat beastkin and classmate Ji Seung-Hoo comes to the rescue. Seung-Hoo lets Ye-Won stay at his house for as long as he needs. But while this feline might seem like a savior at first, it’s really just his scheme to eat up the canine he’s been crushing on for the longest time! \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
